<h1>Tattoo Art Customs Opening Raffle</h1>

<% if (raffleDrawn) { %>
<p><span class="badge ok">Drawn</span> The raffle has been drawn — congratulations to our winners!</p>
<% } else if (raffleOpen) { %>
<p><span class="badge ok">Entries open</span> This raffle runs <strong>at least through November 29, 2026</strong>. It closes after that date when we hit <strong>1,000,000 entries</strong> or <strong>$2,700 in owner subscription profits</strong> — whichever comes first.</p>
<% } else { %>
<p><span class="badge ok">Closed</span> Entries are closed — the drawing is happening within 7 days. Winners will be announced right here, on Instagram, and on Threads.</p>
<% } %>

<section class="card">
  <h2>How to enter</h2>
  <p><strong>Entry is free</strong> — just <a href="/signup">create a free Tattoo Art Customs account</a> and you're in. That's it. No purchase, no membership, no ticket to buy.</p>
  <p>No purchase necessary. 18+ to enter. One entry per person. Winners chosen at random and announced publicly.</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <h2>Entry progress</h2>
  <p><strong><%= raffleEntries.toLocaleString('en-US') %> / <%= entryTarget.toLocaleString('en-US') %></strong> entries so far.</p>
  <% const pct = Math.min(100, (raffleEntries / entryTarget) * 100); %>
  <div style="background:#eee;border-radius:6px;height:14px;overflow:hidden">
    <div style="background:#2a7;height:100%;width:<%= pct.toFixed(4) %>%"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">This raffle runs at least through November 29, 2026. After that it closes when we reach 1,000,000 entries or $2,700 in owner subscription profits — whichever comes first. Drawing happens within 7 days after close, and winners are announced publicly on this site, Instagram, and Threads.</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <h2>Prizes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Grand prize:</strong> your choice of <strong>any premade design</strong> (full color + clean linework, delivered) <strong>plus one free month of site membership</strong></li>
    <li><strong>2 runners-up:</strong> each gets one free premade design of their choice</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<% if (!raffleDrawn && raffleOpen) { %>
<section class="card">
  <h2>Get in the raffle</h2>
  <% if (alreadyEntered) { %>
  <p><span class="badge ok">You're in!</span> One entry per person — you're already entered. Good luck!</p>
  <% } else { %>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/signup">Create a free account and enter →</a></p>
  <% } %>
</section>
<% } %>

<% if (winners && winners.length) { %>
<section class="card">
  <h2>Winners</h2>
  <ul>
  <% winners.forEach(function(w) { %>
    <li><strong><%= w.display_name || 'A lucky member' %></strong> —
      <% if (w.prize_won === 'grand') { %>Grand prize: any premade design of choice + 1 free month of membership
      <% } else { %>Runner-up: free premade design of choice<% } %></li>
  <% }); %>
  </ul>
</section>
<% } %>
